WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.337
Spark is not always the right tool.

00:00:02.337 --> 00:00:10.487
A conventional database may be better for transactional workloads, frequent small updates, low-latency point lookups,

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:13.017
and strict relational constraints.

00:00:13.017 --> 00:00:18.407
If the data fits comfortably in the database and the query workload is already efficient,

00:00:18.407 --> 00:00:21.885
moving to Spark may add complexity without much benefit.
